EPIC-260716-3fyjn0_manual-validation-and-approvals/STORY-260819-r1cx8r_dedicated-macos-vpn-test-host-safety/TASK-260819-16oo3p_enforce-build-host-no-vpn-activation-policy/README.md:4:Implement a fail-closed repository and board policy that prevents real VPN installation or activation on the current development Mac and requires an explicit separate test-host identity for physical validation.
